      "claim": "Einstein’s photo‑electric equation gives the maximum kinetic energy of emitted electrons as Kₘₐₓ = h·ν – φ.",
      "evidence": "Experimental verification of the linear increase of kinetic energy with light frequency; derived from energy conservation for a photon of energy hν liberating an electron with work function φ.",
